  "name": "Lacuna",
  "description": "A scientific Python package and BIDS-App for reproducible analysis of brain lesions. Lacuna characterizes focal lesions in the context of brain networks and regions — functional and structural lesion network mapping, accelerated functional network mapping, focal damage scoring, and parcel-wise aggregation — on standardized MNI reference spaces, fetching the required normative connectomes, templates, and atlases on demand.",
